{"product_id":"smok-novo-4-25w-pod-kit","title":"SMOK Novo 4 25W Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the SMOK NOVO 4 25W Pod Kit, featuring a 5-25W range, adjustable airflow, and equipped with the LP1 Coil Series. Search for the best vape gears and wide selection of E-Liquids at your favorite online vape shop!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNote: The pods are not compatible with other NOVO series.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Smok Novo 4 Empty Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-4-empty-pods\"\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK LP1 Replacement Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0656\/8630\/7047\/files\/NOVO_4_INFOGRAPHIC.jpg?v=1662469625\" alt=\"novo 4 infographic\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdopting an adjustable airflow dial, the SMOK Novo 4 can deliver a controlled stream of air to create the ideal draw. In addition, the NOVO 4 Pod System utilizes a 0.49\" OLED Display Screen to relay any wattage or vaping information and can adjust the wattage between 5-25W with a single button that doubles as an On\/Off button. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salt in the magnetic pod, the NOVO 4 utilizes coils from the SMOK LP Coil Series, to deliver satisfying vapor without any pesky leaks.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK NOVO 4 25W Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 93.5mm by 26.5mm by 17.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 0.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.4-3.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.49\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle Button Operation - Wattage Adjustment \u0026amp; On\/Off\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRotating Airflow Intake\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Detection Function\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm LP1 Meshed Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Charging Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 NOVO 4 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 2mL NOVO 4 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.8ohm LP1 Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531770503223,"sku":"69d25d4c81d66","price":4649.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_novo_4_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741710024","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-novo-4-25w-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




